aseline rewards. The New Springs is carried only if a later Winterspring visit is actually selected. | The Fare of Lar'korwi Find the carcass of Lar'korwi's freshest kill and steal a Piece of Threshadon Carcass before returning to Torwa Pathfinder in Un'Goro Crater . Piece of Threshadon Carcass ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Larion and Muigin", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 4145, title = "Larion and Muigin"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4145, title = "Larion and Muigin", rewards = {xp = 5100}}}, note = "The Scent of Lar'korwi Bring 2 Ravasaur Pheromone Glands to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater . Ravasaur Pheromone Gland ( 2 ) "}, {title = "Beware of Pterrordax", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 4501, title = "Beware of Pterrordax"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4501, title = "Beware of Pterrordax", rewards = {xp = 5650}}}, note = "The Bait for Lar'korwi Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch , summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater . Lar'korwi's Head ( 1 ) Provided item: Torwa's Pouch ( 1 ) "}, {title = "The Apes of Un'Goro", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 4289, title = "The Apes of Un'Goro", minLevel = 47, qlvl = 55}, {t = "complete", quest = 4289, title = "The Apes of Un'Goro"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4289, title = "The Apes of Un'Goro", rewards = {xp = 5650}}}, note = "The Northern Pylon Discover the location of the Northern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater . Discover and examine the Northern Crystal Pylon ( 1 ) "}, {title = "The Mighty U'cha", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 4301, title = "The Mighty U'cha", minLevel = 50, qlvl = 55}, {t = "complete", quest = 4301, title = "The Mighty U'cha"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4301, title = "The Mighty U'cha", rewards = {xp = 5650}}}, note = "The Eastern Pylon Discover the location of the Eastern Crystal Pylon in Un'Goro Crater . Discover and examine the Eastern Crystal Pylon ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Finding the Source", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 974, title = "Finding the Source"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 974, title = "Finding the Source", rewards = {xp = 5650}}}, note = "The Western Pylon Discover the location of the Western Crystal Pylon. Discover and examine the Western Crystal Pylon ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Lost!", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 4492, title = "Lost!"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4492, title = "Lost!", rewards = {xp = 2800}}}, note = "The Apes of Un'Goro Bring 2 Un'Goro Gorilla Pelts , 2 Un'Goro Stomper Pelts , and 2 Un'Goro Thunderer Pelts to Torwa Pathfinder at the entrance of Un'Goro Crater . Un'Goro Gorilla Pelt ( 2 ) Un'Goro Stomper Pelt ( 2 ) Un'Goro Thunderer Pelt ( 2 )  | The guide must not count a single kill twice when it satisfies more than one quest. | The optional queen chain needs a real Gadgetzan return between Bungle in the Jungle and Pawn Captures Queen; it cannot be completed on one uninterrupted hive visit."}}})
 end
