oon Well Water to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood . Purified Moonwell Water (Provided) ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Dousing the Flames of Protection", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 5165, title = "Dousing the Flames of Protection", minLevel = 48, qlvl = 55}, {t = "complete", quest = 5165, title = "Dousing the Flames of Protection"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 5165, title = "Dousing the Flames of Protection", rewards = {xp = 5650}}}, note = "Dousing the Flames of Protection Using the Purified Moon Well Water, douse the flames of the four braziers of protection within Shadow Hold in Felwood , then return to Greta Mosshoof in the Emerald Sanctuary. Extinguish the Brazier of Pain ( 1 ) Extinguish the Brazier of Malice ( 1 ) Extinguish the Brazier of Suffering ( 1 ) Extinguish the Brazier of Hatred ( 1 ) Provided item: Purified Moonwell Water ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Pick up: Well of Corruption, Verifying the Corruption", note = "At Bloodvenom Post take Well of Corruption4505 and Verifying the Corruption5156. Do the moonwell bottle objective and the relevant wildlife/ooze kills on the circuit.", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 4505, title = "Well of Corruption", minLevel = 49, qlvl = 54}, {t = "accept", quest = 5156, title = "Verifying the Corruption", minLevel = 48, qlvl = 54}}}, {title = "Well of Corruption", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 4505, title = "Well of Corruption"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4505, title = "Well of Corruption", rewards = {xp = 5450}}}, note = "At Bloodvenom Post take Well of Corruption4505 and Verifying the Corruption5156. Do the moonwell bottle objective and the relevant wildlife/ooze kills on the circuit. | Well of Corruption Collect a sample of corrupted water from the Jadefire Satyrs' moonwell and bring it to Winna Hazzard at Bloodvenom Post. Filled Flasket ( 1 ) Provided item: Hardened Flasket ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Corrupted Sabers", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 4506, title = "Corrupted Sabers", minLevel = 49, qlvl = 54}, {t = "complete", quest = 4506, title = "Corrupted Sabers"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 4506, title = "Corrupted Sabers", rewards = {xp = 5450}}}, note = "Verifying the Corruption Seek out and destroy 2 Entropic Beasts and 2 Entropic Horrors while exploring Shatter Scar Vale. After checking to see if the craters there are still filled with corrupt fel water, return to Taronn Redfeather in Felwood . Entropic Beast slain ( 2 ) Entropic Horror slain ( 2 ) Explore Zone ( 1 ) Explore the craters in Shatter Scar Vale ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Verifying the Corruption", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 5156, title = "Verifying the Corruption"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 5156, title = "Verifying the Corruption", rewards = {xp = 6800}}}, note = "Return Well of Corruption4505 to Winna BEFORE accepting Corrupted Sabers4506. Make the second moonwell visit with the kitten, then escort the transformed saber back and release it as the quest requires. Combine this second circuit with any remaining Strength of Corruption kills. | Corrupted Sabers Take Winna's kitten to the corrupted moon well, release it, then bring it back to Winna. Once you have returned to Winna, click on the cat to release it to Winna. Return the corrupted cat to Winna Hazzard ( 1 ) Provided item: Winna's Kitten Carrier ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Pick up: Stag Lord's Bauble", note = "Interact with the fixed Statue of Malorne at42.0,47.5 for Stag Lord's Bauble86612; deliver it to Winna on the next Bloodvenom Post turn-in.", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 86612, title = "Stag Lord's Bauble", minLevel = 48, qlvl = 55}}}, {title = "Stag Lord's Bauble", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 86612, title = "Stag Lord's Bauble"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 86612, title = "Stag Lord's Bauble", rewards = {xp = 2800}}}, note = "Interact with the fixed Statue of Malorne at42.0,47.5 for Stag Lord's Bauble86612; deliver it to Winna on the next Bloodvenom Post turn-in. | Stag Lord's Bauble Take the Stag Lord's Bauble to someone in Bloodvenom Post who may know about it. Stag Lord's Bauble (Provided) ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Pick up: A Final Blow", note = "After Dousing the Flames, take A Final Blow5242 and defeat Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan with the full group. These are higher-level targets; use crowd control and finish with everyone in credit range.", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 5242, title = "A Final Blow", minLevel = 48, qlvl = 58}}}, {title = "Speak to Nafien", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 8462, title = "Speak to Nafien", minLevel = 45, qlvl = 55}, {t = "turnin", quest = 8462, title = "Speak to Nafien", rewards = {xp = 560}}}, note = "After Dousing the Flames, take A Final Blow5242 and defeat Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan with the full group. These are higher-level targets; use crowd control and finish with everyone in credit range. | A Final Blow Kill Moora and Salia , and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood . Moora slain ( 1 ) Salia slain ( 1 ) Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head ( 1 ) "}, {title = "Pick up: Deadwood of the North", note = "Complete Speak to Nafien8462 and Deadwood of the North8461. Finish Speak to Salfa8465 at the Winterspring side of the tunnel if traversable; no Neutral reputation grind is added.", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 8461, title = "Deadwood of the North", minLevel = 45, qlvl = 55}}}, {title = "Deadwood of the North", goals = {{t = "complete", quest = 8461, title = "Deadwood of the North"}, {t = "turnin", quest = 8461, title = "Deadwood of the North", rewards = {xp = 5650}}}, note = "Complete Speak to Nafien8462 and Deadwood of the North8461. Finish Speak to Salfa8465 at the Winterspring side of the tunnel if traversable; no Neutral reputation grind is added. | Speak to Nafien Travel north along the main road in Felwood and speak with the furbolg named Nafien . He stands guard outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold. "}, {title = "Speak to Salfa", goals = {{t = "accept", quest = 8465, title = "Speak to Salfa", minLevel = 45, qlvl = 55}, {t = "turnin", quest = 8465, title = "Speak 